OL,3,GNEWSAConvicted killer found guilty of
OL,4,Amurdering Uddingston man
OL,5,
OL,6,FA convicted killer has been found
OL,7,Fguilty of the murder of a man during a
OL,8,Fbrutal machete attack.
OL,10,FLiam Kippen, 31, struck David Graham,
OL,11,F38, in Uddingston before the victim's
OL,12,Fwife went to his aid and screamed for
OL,13,Fhelp for her dying husband.
OL,15,FKippen lied that he only hit David ` a
OL,16,Frelative stranger to him ` because he
OL,17,Fwas apparently armed and feared he was
OL,18,Fgoing to be assaulted.
